ven while ten&amp;#39;s of thousands of them are being slaughtered in the Middle East, the media is silent. The politically correct media being noted. &lt;br /&gt;Be more concerned with people&amp;#39;s rights being violated because when they came for the unionist I didn&amp;#39;t care because I wasn&amp;#39;t a unionist. Injustice of any kind against people&amp;#39;s rights to live free and not bother any others, is an injustice to all who want to be and remain free. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6255012792423413410/comments/default/8319692483773939075'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6255012792423413410/comments/default/8319692483773939075'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/09/no-protection-long-ordeal-of-cyndi.html?showComment=1410701923346#c8319692483773939075' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/09/no-protection-long-ordeal-of-cyndi.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6255012792423413410' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6255012792423413410' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-425182497"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 14, 2014 at 7:38 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7821550086745068062</id><published>2014-09-12T10:48:25.786-06:00</published><updated>2014-09-12T10:48:25.786-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Saw this and thought of Mr. Grigg&#xa;&#xa;http://www.yout...</title><content type='html'>Saw this and thought of Mr. Grigg&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;ht